# Keep credentials, exports, tests and unrelated files out of the build context.
# Everything is excluded first; only packaging inputs, the dependency locks and
# the package source and data that pyproject.toml ships are re-included.
#
# Never re-include a directory here ("!shadowscan/" or "!shadowscan/**/"): the
# docker and BuildKit matcher treats a matching parent directory as a match for
# every file below it, which would readmit __pycache__/*.pyc and any other
# untracked file under the package. The builder sends the Dockerfile and this
# file regardless of these rules.
**
!pyproject.toml
!requirements*.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!agent-card.yaml
!shadowscan/**/*.py
!shadowscan/py.typed
!shadowscan/signatures/data/**/*.yaml
